  effects: [],
  mechanics: [],
  lore: {
    about: "A higher-dimensional being originated from Aleph-1, which shaped its body with Exoswarm devoured by the Void Storm and forged its spine with the Exostrider's remnants. To the inhabitants of Lahai-Roi, Voidworm and Void Storm are equally terrifying. Both are unpredictable natural disasters that devour everything in their paths.",
    undiscovered: "A shadow looming in the sand and storm.<br>An abomination woven from tens of thousands of Exoswarm.<br>Listen—the void-star hums, and it is near.",
  },
